{"title":"Illumination Man","ru":"Illumination Man","kind":"character","url":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/Illumination_Man","blocks":[{"tag":"p","text":"Illumination Man — взрослый тама мужского пола, который появляется в Tamagotchi! аниме."},{"tag":"h2","text":"О персонаже"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Стадия роста"},{"tag":"p","text":"Взрослая форма"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Родной город"},{"tag":"p","text":"Tama Street"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Аниме"},{"tag":"p","text":"Мужчина:"},{"tag":"li","text":"Tamagotchi!"},{"tag":"li","text":"ВПЕРЕД Tamagotchi!"},{"tag":"h2","text":"Внешность"},{"tag":"p","text":"Illumination Man — высокий белый Tamagotchi с телом овальной формы. Он носит желтую кепку и пояс с надписью «Свет». Обычно он находится рядом со сценическим светом, имеющим свое лицо."},{"tag":"h2","text":"В аниме"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Tamagotchi!"},{"tag":"p","text":"Illumination Man работает на TAMAX-TV светотехником. Он отвечает за управление светом для телевизионных постановок и сценических шоу. Его обычно можно увидеть в сценах, где съемочная группа TAMAX-TV снимает шоу."},{"tag":"h2","text":"Галерея"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Иллюстрации"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Рождество 2023 года"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Аниме"}],"imageSource":"","gallery":[{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TAMAXChristmasArtwork2023.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/98/TAMAXChristmasArtwork2023.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20231225053721","caption":"Рождество 2023 года","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/98/TAMAXChristmasArtwork2023.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20231225053721"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:0144f0b1.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7a/0144f0b1.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210511093301","caption":"Из альбома «Illumination Man» · № 2","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7a/0144f0b1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210511093301"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:S2E36_LovelinRestaurant.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/49/S2E36_LovelinRestaurant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210817182009","caption":"Сезон 2, серия 36 · Lovelin","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/49/S2E36_LovelinRestaurant.png/revision/latest?cb=20210817182009"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:EP_117_0000846228ms.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/92/EP_117_0000846228ms.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220626101338","caption":"Кадр из серии 117 · Illumination Man","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/92/EP_117_0000846228ms.png/revision/latest?cb=20220626101338"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:408580_original.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/ed/408580_original.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20160105023622","caption":"Из альбома «Illumination Man» · № 5","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/ed/408580_original.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160105023622"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:IlluminationMan.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/64/IlluminationMan.png/revision/latest?cb=20220713141034","caption":"Портрет · Illumination Man"}],"related":[]}